{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":14561,\"title\":\"Comeback Season\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"First Down. Second Chance. Skylar is a star quarterback of his football team. He's got the skills, the looks, and the girls. His next-door neighbor, Walter is a loving husband, good father and all-round decent family man. When their worlds start to crumble they find themselves in jail together and suddenly these former enemies must rely on each other to rebuild their lives...\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ibgZljH0PDLiMquEnKoCm3qauHp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nQYol95buccUZWF8Kg6BpgauUQx.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":46,\"year\":2006,\"runtime\":99,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Romance\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"},{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"Canada\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Bruce McCulloch\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":73499,\"name\":\"Bruce McCulloch\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mknOQPuT4PTA5Qjxz4xx95krkwR.jpg\"},{\"id\":11477,\"name\":\"Ray Liotta\",\"character\":\"Walter Pearce\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ve9sB0o1MYTaL2SXEisVW2RMkD5.jpg\"},{\"id\":65772,\"name\":\"Shaun Sipos\",\"character\":\"Skylar Eckerman\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jc3Zy3lhMGIfk43BkBNrfRrfun.jpg\"},{\"id\":21104,\"name\":\"Glenne Headly\",\"character\":\"Deborah Pearce\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ucndAdXmTfF6PfZx3tIMOOOOGcL.jpg\"},{\"id\":52478,\"name\":\"Rachel Blanchard\",\"character\":\"Chloe Pearce\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l8vUgOu1xVE1BKVCyrBf4M5PCBG.jpg\"},{\"id\":33292,\"name\":\"Brooke Nevin\",\"character\":\"Christine Pearce\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tVtVgUauFOWRZf5euyxLP9rn9LX.jpg\"},{\"id\":72440,\"name\":\"Brendan Fehr\",\"character\":\"Paul\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb