"Elemental\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4Y1WNkd88JXmGfhtWR7dmDAo1T2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4fLZUr1e65hKPPVw0R3PmKFKxj1.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a city where fire, water, land and air residents live together, a fiery young woman and a go-with-the-flow guy will discover something elemental: how much they have in common.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9880,\"title\":\"The Princess Diaries\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7axhsbEzFan6HQQ1aMOy7w3CFRx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ktPixrzD9Rbet7Co4uUWxyR9191.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A socially awkward but very bright 15-year-old girl being raised by a single mom discovers that she is the princess of a small European country because of the recent death of her long-absent father, who, unknown to her, was the crown prince of Genovia. She must make a choice between continuing the life of a San Francisco teen or stepping up to the throne.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4523,\"title\":\"Enchanted\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8KCNzCArLlvLdQoHx6npua2VSVc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u4UpRDi0w84aNrigr9p049rMHiy.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The beautiful princess Giselle is banished by an evil queen from her magical, musical animated land and finds herself in the gritty reality of the streets of modern-day Manhattan. Shocked by this strange new environment that doesn't operate on a \\\"happily ever after\\\" basis, Giselle is now adrift in a chaotic world badly in need of enchantment. But when Giselle begins to fall in love with a charmingly flawed divorce lawyer who has come to her aid - even though she is already promised to a perfect fairy tale prince back home - she has to wonder: Can a storybook view of romance survive in the real world?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11247,\"title\":\"A Cinderella Story\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ukwP7gDPWxj1R1dW5iN3mnxkL3D.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cxj7Fi2r1fjE8iM2jynhx4YF1Jb.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Routinely exploited by her wicked stepmother, the downtrodden Samantha Montgomery is excited about the prospect of meeting her Internet beau at the school's Halloween dance.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":550205,\"title\":\"Wish Dragon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lnPf6hzANL6pVQTxUlsNYSuhT5l.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4kIRrW1AlHP5Idne8CPHeQt8nR5.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Determined teen Din is longing to reconnect with his childhood best friend when he meets a wish-granting dragon who shows him the magic of possibilities.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11451,\"title\":\"Herbie Fully Loaded\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7lTfTZ8CDfXw09eAv3OOvsbCVgs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u6qrMY2PIzXwmydmKNHmVDFbjaV.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Maggie Peyton, the new owner of Number 53 - the free-wheelin' Volkswagen bug with a mind of its own - puts the car through its paces on the road to becoming a NASCAR competitor.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":512895,\"title\":\"Lady and the Tramp\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8wBEye516IKul9sW7JKGcFXVGfV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nHNNKoqQOIWODk5mMyW8CvDisem.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The love story between a pampered Cocker Spaniel named Lady and a streetwise mongrel named Tramp. Lady finds herself out on the street after her owners have a baby and is saved from a pack by Tramp, who tries to show her to live her life footloose and collar-free.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Romance\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1243341,\"title\":\"Z-O-M-B-I-E-S 4: Dawn of the Vampires\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6rGsqBxI4r1YkS9FuraovWi465w.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/68TGPnvmZ21NBOoV5IUZ4fQDyvZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A new adventure dawns for Zed and Addison when their summer road trip takes an unexpected detour, landing them in the middle of yet another monster rivalry: Daywalkers vs. Vampires. Tensions flare when Zed and Addison find themselves acting as camp counselors between the two opposing supernatural factions. With the help of Eliza and Willa, they must convince sworn enemies Nova and Victor to try to unite their warring worlds before an even greater threat endangers them all.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10947,\"title\":\"High School Musical\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1DGmWZjUJPeKGFRHGCA6VPFUBML.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2p1nyBVSEBiCTrrZeVSV9nIsqHr.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A popular high school athlete and an academically gifted girl get roles in the school musical and develop a friendship that threatens East High's social order.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":486589,\"title\":\"Red Shoes and the Seven Dwarfs\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/MBiKqTsouYqAACLYNDadsjhhC0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nN4Gs3vZAOJ1D6FRtrwbU9VGYwU.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Princes who have been turned into Dwarfs seek the red shoes of a lady in order to break the spell, although it will not be easy.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Fantasy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4942,\"title\":\"Leatherheads\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dl2yu8iuwG3dqbpjalm2odadRaH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p6sqf1ujNfaQepZgVC7j3E0dU0B.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A light hearted comedy about the beginnings of Professional American Football. When a decorated war hero and college all star is tempted into playing professional football. Everyone see the chance to make some big money, but when a reporter digs up some dirt on the war hero... everyone could lose out.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"I114Mzw7pYc\",\"name\":\"Comeback Season - Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}